    {
      "id": "claim_4e0a97bcb62745c3a1ca33ef0b731256",
      "statement": "Ambient gatekeeper provisioning uses a per-vendor three-state mode stored in AdminConfig.ambientGatekeeperModes and resolved by provisioning-policy.ts as the single chokepoint: disabled (nothing provisioned, existing dormant), optional (user opt-in from Connectors — the default, so ambient authority is never imposed without an admin opting in), and enabled (auto-provisioned for every user, forced and not user-removable).",
      "evidence": [
